<title>POLAND: RAFAKO SWINGS TO PLN 0.2 MLN LOSS IN NOV.</title>
<headline>RAFAKO SWINGS TO PLN 0.2 MLN LOSS IN NOV.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.24 vs   0.97 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.24 vs   2.04 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.42 vs   5.68</p>
<p> Sales		   22.85 vs  31.23</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    11.64 vs  17.99</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.64 vs  29.45</p>
<p> Operating profit    24.90 vs  38.74</p>
<p> Sales		  345.54 vs 332.46</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial boiler maker is</p>
<p>Fabryka Kotlow Rafako SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
